{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：08:50 2026-08-15 HKT</p>\n\n<p>沙田發生墮樓事件。今(15日)早上7時13分，沙角邨保安員報案，指一名男子倒臥在銀鷗樓對開行人路上，懷疑由高處墮下。救護員接報到場，經檢驗後證實男事主當場不治。警方經初步調查，相信姓林(32歲)男子從上址一樓梯墮下。警方於現場檢獲遺書。死因有待驗屍後確定。據悉，事主有精神病紀錄。</p>\n<img alt=\"屍體由綠色帳篷遮蓋。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/23c9807a69f59265e3b4dcdf13cdd028/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_08_45_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6458a29d849ee12e3387a716b1d8a23c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_08_45_09.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子梯間墮下不治。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9998a01d3534eadf34bf03c60e61b100/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_08_45_08_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/349a6cea9fdc4d95b1c5e619886203b3/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_08_45_08.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0c4b5e461fd43f3fe392d411bb37337d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_08_45_04.jpeg\"/>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T03:38:35.323414+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}